tion":{"start":{"line":23,"column":3,"offset":1165},"end":{"line":23,"column":51,"offset":1213},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.1777272449631","id":"zettel.1777272449631","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":1216},"end":{"line":24,"column":48,"offset":1261},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","id":"zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":4,"column":3,"offset":51},"end":{"line":4,"column":27,"offset":75},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.1777272449631"}],"anchors":{"ide-inti":{"type":"header","text":"Ide inti","value":"ide-inti","line":20,"column":0,"depth":2},"supporting-quotes":{"type":"header","text":"Supporting quotes","value":"supporting-quotes","line":24,"column":0,"depth":2},"kenapa-ini-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Kenapa ini penting","value":"kenapa-ini-penting","line":34,"column":0,"depth":2},"sumber":{"type":"header","text":"Sumber","value":"sumber","line":38,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"otomasi-menggeser-nilai-kerja-dari-eksekusi-manual-ke-desain-dan-adaptasi-sistem\">Otomasi menggeser nilai kerja dari eksekusi manual ke desain dan adaptasi sistem<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#otomasi-menggeser-nilai-kerja-dari-eksekusi-manual-ke-desain-dan-adaptasi-sistem\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"ide-inti\">Ide inti<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#ide-inti\"></a></h2>\n<p>Otomasi bukan cuma bikin kerja lebih cepat. Di bagian Preface ini yang nyantol buat gue adalah bahwa otomatisasi juga bisa menghapus kebutuhan atas skill lama: kalau lo cuma jago di pekerjaan manual yang bisa diotomasi, maka otomatisasi itu sendiri bisa membuat skill lo tidak dibutuhkan lagi.</p>\n<h2 id=\"supporting-quotes\">Supporting quotes<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#supporting-quotes\"></a></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“This got repetitive and boring really fast. So what does any good programmer do? Automate.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“The business teams could now update the entire intranet website on their own.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“The company no longer had a need for their skillset because their jobs had been automated.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“If you are going to make it in this field, you need to stay current with technology. Otherwise, you may be the one automated out of a job.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"kenapa-ini-penting\">Kenapa ini penting<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#kenapa-ini-penting\"></a></h2>\n<p>Inti pelajaran karier yang gue tangkap bukanlah \"jangan bikin otomasi.\" Justru sebaliknya: kalau lo bikin otomasi, lo harus siap pindah ke lapisan skill yang lebih baru — yang membangun, mengarahkan, dan beradaptasi dengan sistem baru. Itu yang bikin preface ini terasa relevan bukan cuma untuk AI, tapi untuk semua gelombang otomasi di software engineering.</p>\n<h2 id=\"sumber\">Sumber<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#sumber\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Part I / Preface</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI sebagai literature note</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">automation (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">career (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">the-developers-guide-to-ai (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">part-i (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.moc.the-developers-guide-to-ai\">MOC The Developer's Guide to AI</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMultiSelect":false},"insertNoteIndex":{"enableMarker":false},"copyNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"title"},"templateHierarchy":"template"},"workspace":{"dendronVersion":"0.83.0","vaults":[{"fsPath":"vault"}],"journal":{"dailyDomain":"daily","name":"journal","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd","addBehavior":"childOfDomain"},"scratch":{"name":"scratch","dateFormat":"y.MM.dd.HHmmss","addBehavior":"asOwnDomain"},"task":{"name":"","dateFormat":"","addBehavior":"childOfCurrent","statusSymbols":{"":" ","wip":"w","done":"x","assigned":"a","moved":"m","blocked":"b","delegated":"l","dropped":"d","pending":"y"},"prioritySymbols":{"H":"high","M":"medium","L":"low"},"todoIntegration":false,"createTaskSelectionType":"selection2link","taskCompleteStatus":["done","x"]},"graph":{"zoomSpeed":1,"createStub":false},"enableAu